### main route
GET http://localhost:8080

### create tasks
POST  http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task": "New",
    "status": false
}

### get tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### get tasks with status true
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?status=true

### get tasks with status false
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?status=false

### delete tasks
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/21b31324-68c0-11ef-bfa8-a841f498f056

### update
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/37d31ec9-51d5-11ef-8ec2-21a0c0e0220b
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task": "Eat dinner",
    "status": true
}

### update status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks/37d31ec9-51d5-11ef-8ec2-21a0c0e0220b
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": 0
}